# Lanyan Faruzan Furina Jean. ~20s Rot. Triple Anemo Quickswap. Sac Lanyan skill/bursts twice/once per rot with Faruzan aimed shots & Jean skill in between. MH > GT for Lanyan & Faruzan. EM sands Lanyan is very slightly more DPS for a worse shield.

# Team - Options listed by DPS
lanyan char lvl=90/90 cons=6 talent=9,9,9;
lanyan add weapon="sacfrags" refine=5 lvl=90/90;
lanyan add set="mh" count=4;
#lanyan add set="vv" count=4;
lanyan add stats hp=4780 atk=311 atk%=0.466 anemo%=0.466 cd=0.622; #main
lanyan add stats def%=0.124 def=39.36 hp=507.88 hp%=0.0992 atk=33.08 atk%=0.0992 er=0.3857 em=39.64 cr=0.3972 cd=0.4634; # MH
